[{"answer":"My baby is asleep in my arms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Her soft cheek rests against my chest,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/2.mp3"},{"answer":"while her sweet breath puffs gently on my skin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Her tiny lips are puckered a bit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Her little eyelids flutter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder what she dreams about as she sleeps.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Does she dream?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I have heard her whimper in her sleep.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes she awakens with a scream.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/9.mp3"},{"answer":"What is so scary in her little baby dreams?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Once I heard her giggle as she slept.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Her dreams must have been sweet that day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I have had three babies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The one I am holding now is my last one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/14.mp3"},{"answer":"My other babies are grown up more and now at school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I love their childish play and laughter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I miss their baby dimples and their baby sounds and smells.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/17.mp3"},{"answer":"There is such joy in the birth of a new baby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/18.mp3"},{"answer":"We hear their first little cry,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/19.mp3"},{"answer":"telling us all is well with their small world.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/20.mp3"},{"answer":"We feel their newborn skin, wrinkled, soft and slightly damp.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/21.mp3"},{"answer":"We feel each little limb and are filled with wonder and humility.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Life is good as baby takes its first food from its mother.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Family gathers around, each waiting to hold and love this newest member.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Each time the baby cries, its mom worries, and their bond becomes stronger.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Babies have their own special smell.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Some have described it as \"milk and innocence\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/27.mp3"},{"answer":"It is the sweetest smell on earth, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/28.mp3"},{"answer":"It cannot be copied.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Somehow, it disappears as baby grows.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I love to hear my baby talk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Once in a while I can even understand a little bit!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/32.mp3"},{"answer":"She is so serious in her baby talk that I just have to pick her up and hug her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I love to hear her say \"Mommy\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/34.mp3"},{"answer":"When my baby is tickled, or when the dog or her big brothers do something funny,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/35.mp3"},{"answer":"it is so sweet to hear her baby laugh.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/36.mp3"},{"answer":"It's such a cute little giggle!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes she laughs so hard,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/38.mp3"},{"answer":"her face turns red, tears come to her eyes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/39.mp3"},{"answer":"and she falls down weak with the laughter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Those who watch her can't help but laugh, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope she always laughs so easily.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/42.mp3"},{"answer":"The parents watch with pride and joy as baby grows and has many \"firsts\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/43.mp3"},{"answer":"There is the first time baby sleeps through the night,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/44.mp3"},{"answer":"rolls over, smiles, laughs, hugs and kisses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there is the first tooth, crawling, first step and first word.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/46.mp3"},{"answer":"With each new first, the baby becomes less a baby!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/47.mp3"},{"answer":"These steps are a little sad to parents, too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/48.mp3"},{"answer":"because they know they're \"losing their baby\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/49.mp3"},{"answer":"However, to a mother, even an adult child is still her baby!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/50.mp3"},{"answer":"My baby is not perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes she gets mad or whines for no reason.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/52.mp3"},{"answer":"But, to me, she is still beautiful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Her smiles more than make up for her tears.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Her hugs wipe away when she's been bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I intend to cherish each moment with my baby while I can!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/142-babies-2019-04-07-04-27-42/56.mp3"}]
